            date_format: { type: 'string', enum: [...DATE_FORMATS], description: 'How every date on the documents is written: the date each person signs on, which is the calendar day in the time zone their device reports (failing that the sender\'s zone, then UTC), and any date picked in a date field (sent and stored as YYYY-MM-DD). Left out, a new envelope starts with the account\'s own format, set under Settings, and failing that with YYYY-MM-DD.' },
